{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは〜(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"代々木ライブまで残すところ\nあと4日(OωO )！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頭と体に叩き込むっ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国ツアーの集大成ということで\nわくわくとドキドキが\n入り混じってます(。-ω-)♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"代々木LIVEに来て下さるみなさんも\n10/6に向けて体調万全に\nしといてねΣ(σ`･ω･´)σ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガンガン盛り上がって\nもらいますよ〜(∩^ω^∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/10/03/0620546/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近夜が涼しくて気持ちいいから\nちょこっとお散歩してたら\nある話を思い出したので\n聞いてってくださいっ(((っ･ω･)っ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏の握手会の楽屋での\nななみんとの会話。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ま『今日暑いね〜！』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"な『ね、暑〜！今日外48度あるらしいよ』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ま『え！やばっ(OωO )！！！溶けるよ〜。』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"な『けど明日もっと暑いらしいよ』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ま『え〜...もう外行けない(´._.｀)』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ーーーーーーーーーーーーーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここからは短時間で真夏の\n心の中で思ったことです(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ま(ん？？今日が48度で明日\nそれよりもっと暑いってことは\n50度超えるってこと？！\nやばいじゃんっっ！！)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ま(......つい最近まで\n30度とかだったのに\nそんなことある？？んー。\nでもななみんが言ってるし\n合ってそう......)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というよーなことを思ったので\nちらっと聞いてみることに！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ーーーーーーーーーーーーーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ま『ねぇねぇ、でも48度ってやばくない？50度近いよ(OωO )』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"な『？？？？』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"な『48度？！あ！！！違う違う！38度だ！！』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ま『なんだぁ(*￢ε￢*)』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってわけでななみんは\n勘違いしてただけらしいです（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまにボケるななみん\nかわいい(。-ω-)｡o○"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/10/03/0620546/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば最近blog書いてて\n2回に1回くらい文章が\n全部消えちゃうんです(´°ω°｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そろそろ今の携帯さんに\nお疲れ様を言って新しい携帯さんに\nお世話になろうかなぁヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあまなったんとおしゃべり\ntime(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ♡行きますよ〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q真夏さんのツインテールや\n三つ編み...何歳までやりますか？(ﾟδﾟ)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Aツイン落ち着くけど\n今年で20歳を迎えたし、\n大人っぽさも徐々に出して\nいきたいなぁ...なんて(´-ω-`*)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんな面をみなさんにも\n見てほしいっ(∩^ω^∩)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qまなったんは２０歳になって\n最初にやった事ってなに？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A札幌のzeppライブあとだったから\nホテルで花奈と共に迎えました(人-ω-)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q今のマイブームは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Aことりっぷを集めること(((っ･ω･)っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだあんまりないけど\n少しずつ集めて旅行行く時に\n使おうと思ってるよー♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとはアロマキャンドルを\n集めはじめたヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q今までの乃木どこでどの回が\n1番思い出に残ってますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Aうーん、たくさんあって\nすっごい迷うけど復帰した回と\nスカイダイビングの回は\n思い入れが強いです☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとは2期生が初めて乃木どこに\n出た時に矢田里沙子ちゃんが\n私の名前を出してくれた時も\n結構印象深い回だなぁ♪（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/10/03/0620546/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校のお昼休みに\n友達が撮った写メ∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ寝ないけど...\nおやすみ(。-ω-)｡o○"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/10/03/0620546/0003.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}